{"text_id": "P0-08", "phase": "P0", "level": 0, "category": "多音字", "text": "他骑车去银行，路上走了很长时间。", "pinyin_hint": "行 xíng / háng；长 cháng", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P0-09", "phase": "P0", "level": 0, "category": "多音字", "text": "这件事还得重新商量，你得早点回来。", "pinyin_hint": "得 děi / dé；重 chóng", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P0-10", "phase": "P0", "level": 0, "category": "长句", "text": "虽然今天下雨，但是我们还是决定按原计划去公园散步。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK1-01", "phase": "P1", "level": 1, "category": "HSK1真题", "text": "那家饭店是我朋友开的。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK1-3_Q16_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK1-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/01_中文听力_一级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK1-3/HSK1-3_Q16_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.473, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK1-02", "phase": "P1", "level": 1, "category": "HSK1真题", "text": "王先生,十月八号去中国。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK1-5_Q20_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK1-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/01_中文听力_一级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK1-5/HSK1-5_Q20_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.692, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK1-03", "phase": "P1", "level": 1, "category": "HSK1真题", "text": "我现在好多了,谢谢医生。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK1-1_Q10_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK1-1", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/01_中文听力_一级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK1-1/HSK1-1_Q10_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.708, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK1-04", "phase": "P1", "level": 1, "category": "HSK1真题", "text": "中午,我和朋友在饭店吃饭。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK1-5_Q19_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK1-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/01_中文听力_一级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK1-5/HSK1-5_Q19_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.558, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK1-05", "phase": "P1", "level": 1, "category": "HSK1真题", "text": "他昨天和同学去书店看书了。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK1-4_Q19_U04", "source_exam_key": "HSK1-4", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/01_中文听力_一级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK1-4/HSK1-4_Q19_U04.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.399, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK1-06", "phase": "P1", "level": 1, "category": "HSK1真题", "text": "王先生十月八号去中国。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK1-5_Q20_U04", "source_exam_key": "HSK1-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/01_中文听力_一级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK1-5/HSK1-5_Q20_U04.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.863, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK1-07", "phase": "P1", "level": 1, "category": "HSK1真题", "text": "小王在医院工作,是个医生。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK1-outline_Q17_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK1-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/01_中文听力_一级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK1-outline/HSK1-outline_Q17_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.426, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK1-08", "phase": "P1", "level": 1, "category": "HSK1真题", "text": "我下午不来了,我们明天上午见。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK1-3_Q12_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK1-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/01_中文听力_一级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK1-3/HSK1-3_Q12_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.621, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK2-01", "phase": "P1", "level": 2, "category": "HSK2真题", "text": "我这儿有鸡蛋,你吃一个吧。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK2-4_Q31_U10", "source_exam_key": "HSK2-4", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/02_中文听力_二级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK2-4/HSK2-4_Q31_U10.wav", "source_duration_s": 3.978, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK2-02", "phase": "P1", "level": 2, "category": "HSK2真题", "text": "女的在北京工作了多长时间？", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK2-outline_Q35_U18", "source_exam_key": "HSK2-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/02_中文听力_二级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK2-outline/HSK2-outline_Q35_U18.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.495, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK2-03", "phase": "P1", "level": 2, "category": "HSK2真题", "text": "我在火车站前面的咖啡馆等你。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK2-2_Q33_U04", "source_exam_key": "HSK2-2", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/02_中文听力_二级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK2-2/HSK2-2_Q33_U04.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.895, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK2-04", "phase": "P1", "level": 2, "category": "HSK2真题", "text": "喂,你往后看,我在你后面。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK2-5_Q02_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK2-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/02_中文听力_二级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK2-5/HSK2-5_Q02_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.579, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK2-05", "phase": "P1", "level": 2, "category": "HSK2真题", "text": "我有个朋友,姓王,他说可以送您一只。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK2-3_Q33_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK2-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/02_中文听力_二级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK2-3/HSK2-3_Q33_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.33, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK2-06", "phase": "P1", "level": 2, "category": "HSK2真题", "text": "你别在这儿睡觉,回房间去睡吧。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK2-4_Q12_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK2-4", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/02_中文听力_二级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK2-4/HSK2-4_Q12_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.779, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK2-07", "phase": "P1", "level": 2, "category": "HSK2真题", "text": "现在太晚了,路上车少,我们再等等吧。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK2-4_Q21_U07", "source_exam_key": "HSK2-4", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/02_中文听力_二级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK2-4/HSK2-4_Q21_U07.wav", "source_duration_s": 7.22, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK2-08", "phase": "P1", "level": 2, "category": "HSK2真题", "text": "明天天很冷,可能会下雪。你多穿点衣服。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK2-3_Q28_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK2-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/02_中文听力_二级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK2-3/HSK2-3_Q28_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 7.744, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK3-01", "phase": "P1", "level": 3, "category": "HSK3真题", "text": "女的打算怎么去火车站？", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK3-outline_Q30_U04", "source_exam_key": "HSK3-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/03_中文听力_三级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK3-outline/HSK3-outline_Q30_U04.wav", "source_duration_s": 3.507, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK3-02", "phase": "P1", "level": 3, "category": "HSK3真题", "text": "那条街道离公司比较近。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK3-1_Q14_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK3-1", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/03_中文听力_三级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK3-1/HSK3-1_Q14_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 3.554, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK3-03", "phase": "P1", "level": 3, "category": "HSK3真题", "text": "以前没这么冷,今年的天气比较奇怪。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK3-1_Q29_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK3-1", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/03_中文听力_三级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK3-1/HSK3-1_Q29_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.435, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK3-04", "phase": "P1", "level": 3, "category": "HSK3真题", "text": "上的字太小了,好多地方都看不清楚。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK3-4_Q21_U04", "source_exam_key": "HSK3-4", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/03_中文听力_三级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK3-4/HSK3-4_Q21_U04.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.961, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK3-05", "phase": "P1", "level": 3, "category": "HSK3真题", "text": "那你教几班?我女儿在二年级三班。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK3-5_Q34_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK3-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/03_中文听力_三级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK3-5/HSK3-5_Q34_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.944, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK3-06", "phase": "P1", "level": 3, "category": "HSK3真题", "text": "孩子要多喝牛奶,多锻炼。这样个子才能长高。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK3-1_Q13_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK3-1", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/03_中文听力_三级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK3-1/HSK3-1_Q13_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 7.855, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK3-07", "phase": "P1", "level": 3, "category": "HSK3真题", "text": "有些看足球赛的人不懂足球。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK3-3_Q19_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK3-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/03_中文听力_三级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK3-3/HSK3-3_Q19_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.084, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK3-08", "phase": "P1", "level": 3, "category": "HSK3真题", "text": "明天就要考试了,大家都在复习呢。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK3-3_Q09_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK3-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/03_中文听力_三级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK3-3/HSK3-3_Q09_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.811, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK4-01", "phase": "P1", "level": 4, "category": "HSK4真题", "text": "是啊,这几天热得我都快受不了了。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK4-1_Q32_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK4-1", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/04_中文听力_四级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK4-1/HSK4-1_Q32_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.829, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK4-02", "phase": "P1", "level": 4, "category": "HSK4真题", "text": "第四十二到四十三题是根据下面一段话。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK4-2_Q42_U01", "source_exam_key": "HSK4-2", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/04_中文听力_四级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK4-2/HSK4-2_Q42_U01.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.129, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK4-03", "phase": "P1", "level": 4, "category": "HSK4真题", "text": "花儿是不是缺水了,叶子都黄了。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK4-4_Q22_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK4-4", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/04_中文听力_四级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK4-4/HSK4-4_Q22_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.586, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK4-04", "phase": "P1", "level": 4, "category": "HSK4真题", "text": "是的,医院这次只要三个人,但一共有七十人参加应聘呢。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK4-5_Q26_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK4-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/04_中文听力_四级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK4-5/HSK4-5_Q26_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.397, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK4-05", "phase": "P1", "level": 4, "category": "HSK4真题", "text": "你知道小兰去哪儿了吗?她的手机一直占线。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK4-outline_Q31_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK4-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/04_中文听力_四级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK4-outline/HSK4-outline_Q31_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.947, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK4-06", "phase": "P1", "level": 4, "category": "HSK4真题", "text": "有一次我和女朋友约会,她发短信给我,我五分钟后到,如果没到,你就再读一遍短信。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK4-2_Q02_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK4-2", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/04_中文听力_四级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK4-2/HSK4-2_Q02_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 11.95, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK4-07", "phase": "P1", "level": 4, "category": "HSK4真题", "text": "这叫多肉植物,你要是喜欢,我可以送你一颗。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK4-5_Q30_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK4-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/04_中文听力_四级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK4-5/HSK4-5_Q30_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.85, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK4-08", "phase": "P1", "level": 4, "category": "HSK4真题", "text": "大球出了一身汗,你帮我拿条毛巾吧。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK4-3_Q31_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK4-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/04_中文听力_四级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK4-3/HSK4-3_Q31_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.047, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK5-01", "phase": "P1", "level": 5, "category": "HSK5真题", "text": "不是这么简单。下次我给你带一瓶,你尝尝就知道了。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK5-1_Q30_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK5-1", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/05_中文听力_五级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK5-1/HSK5-1_Q30_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.179, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK5-02", "phase": "P1", "level": 5, "category": "HSK5真题", "text": "这是我的记者证和邀请函。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK5-2_Q25_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK5-2", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/05_中文听力_五级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK5-2/HSK5-2_Q25_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 3.446, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK5-03", "phase": "P1", "level": 5, "category": "HSK5真题", "text": "第三十九到四十一题是根据下面一段话。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK5-outline_Q39_U01", "source_exam_key": "HSK5-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/05_中文听力_五级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK5-outline/HSK5-outline_Q39_U01.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.964, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK5-04", "phase": "P1", "level": 5, "category": "HSK5真题", "text": "你学好多少,我帮你看看。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK5-5_Q28_U05", "source_exam_key": "HSK5-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/05_中文听力_五级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK5-5/HSK5-5_Q28_U05.wav", "source_duration_s": 2.858, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK5-05", "phase": "P1", "level": 5, "category": "HSK5真题", "text": "这边水很浅,下来一起玩吧。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK5-5_Q10_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK5-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/05_中文听力_五级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK5-5/HSK5-5_Q10_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 3.825, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK5-06", "phase": "P1", "level": 5, "category": "HSK5真题", "text": "你头发怎么湿了？外面没下雨呀。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK5-outline_Q24_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK5-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/05_中文听力_五级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK5-outline/HSK5-outline_Q24_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.385, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK5-07", "phase": "P1", "level": 5, "category": "HSK5真题", "text": "女儿第一次离家这么久,不知道她有没有照顾好自己。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK5-3_Q22_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK5-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/05_中文听力_五级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK5-3/HSK5-3_Q22_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.63, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK5-08", "phase": "P1", "level": 5, "category": "HSK5真题", "text": "最难忘的是在黄山看日出,景色美极了,像仙境一样。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK5-4_Q16_U03", "source_exam_key": "HSK5-4", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/05_中文听力_五级_真题1-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK5-4/HSK5-4_Q16_U03.wav", "source_duration_s": 7.736, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK6-01", "phase": "P1", "level": 6, "category": "HSK6真题", "text": "根据这段话，下列哪向正确？", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK6-outline_Q50_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK6-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/07_中文听力_六级_真题4-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK6-outline/HSK6-outline_Q50_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 3.052, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK6-02", "phase": "P1", "level": 6, "category": "HSK6真题", "text": "第四十八到五十题是根据下面一段话。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK6-3_Q48_U01", "source_exam_key": "HSK6-3", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/06_中文听力_六级_真题1-3/data/HSK6-3/HSK6-3_Q48_U01.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.112, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK6-03", "phase": "P1", "level": 6, "category": "HSK6真题", "text": "女的认为拥有良好的口才有什么好处？", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK6-outline_Q22_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK6-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/07_中文听力_六级_真题4-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK6-outline/HSK6-outline_Q22_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 3.922, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK6-04", "phase": "P1", "level": 6, "category": "HSK6真题", "text": "三十二、正谷改那个字的理由是什么？", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK6-outline_Q32_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK6-outline", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/07_中文听力_六级_真题4-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK6-outline/HSK6-outline_Q32_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 2.963, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK6-05", "phase": "P1", "level": 6, "category": "HSK6真题", "text": "多媒体在这部作品中是一个很重要的辅助手段,这在你之前的作品中好像并不多见。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK6-4_Q21_U10", "source_exam_key": "HSK6-4", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/07_中文听力_六级_真题4-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK6-4/HSK6-4_Q21_U10.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.755, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK6-06", "phase": "P1", "level": 6, "category": "HSK6真题", "text": "如果想应聘人力资源职位,最好不要说自己有什么缺点。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK6-1_Q46_U02", "source_exam_key": "HSK6-1", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/06_中文听力_六级_真题1-3/data/HSK6-1/HSK6-1_Q46_U02.wav", "source_duration_s": 6.086, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK6-07", "phase": "P1", "level": 6, "category": "HSK6真题", "text": "第三十四到三十六题是根据下面一段话。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK6-5_Q34_U01", "source_exam_key": "HSK6-5", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/07_中文听力_六级_真题4-5及大纲样卷/data/HSK6-5/HSK6-5_Q34_U01.wav", "source_duration_s": 5.035, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-HSK6-08", "phase": "P1", "level": 6, "category": "HSK6真题", "text": "第二十一到二十五题是根据下面一段采访。", "pinyin_hint": "", "source": "corpus", "source_sample_id": "HSK6-1_Q21_U01", "source_exam_key": "HSK6-1", "source_audio": "/data/shangguanrz/projectsss/speakgenerate/data/06_中文听力_六级_真题1-3/data/HSK6-1/HSK6-1_Q21_U01.wav", "source_duration_s": 4.403, "review_status": "automatic_unproofread", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-01", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "多音字-行", "text": "他一边骑车一边听音乐，很快就到了银行门口。", "pinyin_hint": "行 xíng / háng", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-02", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "多音字-长", "text": "这条马路很长，两边种满了高大的树。", "pinyin_hint": "长 cháng / zhǎng", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-03", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "多音字-重", "text": "这个箱子太重了，请你重新搬一次。", "pinyin_hint": "重 zhòng / chóng", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-04", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "多音字-得", "text": "你得把作业写完，才能出去玩得开心。", "pinyin_hint": "得 děi / de / dé", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-05", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "多音字-还", "text": "他还有一本书没还给我，说明天还。", "pinyin_hint": "还 hái / huán", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-06", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "多音字-都", "text": "我们都去过首都，那里的人都很热情。", "pinyin_hint": "都 dōu / dū", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-07", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "多音字-发", "text": "他发现理发店今天不开门，只好明天再理发。", "pinyin_hint": "发 fā / fà", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-08", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "多音字-觉", "text": "我觉得睡觉以前应该少看手机。", "pinyin_hint": "觉 jué / jiào", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-09", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "数字-年份电话", "text": "二零零八年八月八号，我打了电话零幺零八八八八六六六六。", "pinyin_hint": "幺 yāo", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-10", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "数字-数量分数", "text": "三百二十五个学生里，有四分之三的人通过了考试。", "pinyin_hint": "分数读法", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-11", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "数字-价格小数", "text": "这件衣服原价一百九十九块，现在打八点五折。", "pinyin_hint": "小数与折扣", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
{"text_id": "P1-PR-12", "phase": "P1", "level": 0, "category": "声调-易混", "text": "妈妈骂马，马慢，妈妈骂马慢。", "pinyin_hint": "四声对比 mā má mǎ mà", "source": "original", "source_sample_id": "", "source_exam_key": "", "source_audio": "", "source_duration_s": 0, "review_status": "agent_authored", "needs_human_proofread": true}
